{"id":"da76334bd8496c66","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-supremum.md","title":"Supremum","display":"df-supremum — Supremum","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-supremum","aliases":["58-df-supremum"],"display":"df-supremum — Supremum","depends_on":["[[../batch01/58-df-union-gen.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-supremum"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-supremum</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-supremum — Supremum"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"155dfdcd961bd88a\" href=\"?note=155dfdcd961bd88a\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-union-gen.md\">../batch01/58-df-union-gen.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in V\">\\(A\\in V\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\alpha\\in A\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\">\\(\\forall\\alpha\\in A\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sup(A)\">\\(\\sup(A)\\)</span> 为序数序下的上确界</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}supremum} \\vdash \\sup(A)\\coloneqq\\bigcup A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}supremum} \\vdash \\sup(A)\\coloneqq\\bigcup A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}supremum\\text{-}least} \\vdash\n\\left[\\forall\\alpha\\in A\\;(\\alpha\\leq\\sup(A))\\right]\\land\n\\left[\n\\forall\\beta\\in V\\;\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\left[\\forall\\alpha\\in A\\;(\\alpha\\leq\\beta)\\right]\n\\to\n\\sup(A)\\leq\\beta\n\\right)\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}supremum\\text{-}least} \\vdash\n\\left[\\forall\\alpha\\in A\\;(\\alpha\\leq\\sup(A))\\right]\\land\n\\left[\n\\forall\\beta\\in V\\;\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\left[\\forall\\alpha\\in A\\;(\\alpha\\leq\\beta)\\right]\n\\to\n\\sup(A)\\leq\\beta\n\\right)\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>此式定义的是序数类在自然良序下的上确界；一般偏序中的上确界不能无条件等同于集合并。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch01/58-df-union-gen.md","status":"resolved","id":"155dfdcd961bd88a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-union-gen.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\in V$ 且 $\\forall\\alpha\\in A\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)$（see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in V